        Root cause:
        The bug is caused by the use of a per-network-namespace slab (`drc_slab`) for the duplicate reply cache, which can lead to potential circular locking dependencies and memory management issues when multiple network namespaces are involved. This design complicates the locking mechanism and can result in warnings related to circular locking dependencies, as indicated by the lockdep warning in the commit message.

